---
source: crates/leptoskit_db_schema/tests/diff.rs
expression: sqlite.validate().unwrap_err().to_string()
---
the schema has 3 problem(s):
  - items: on SQLite a vector column's index numbers its rows in `lk_row`, so the key can't use that name
  - posts.terms: sparse vectors need Postgres: sqlite-vec has no sparse type; use `Vector<N>` on SQLite
  - posts.wide: a vector on sqlite has 1 to 8192 dimensions, not 9000
